ok - .omp watch extension: fm_watch_arm_omp arms once, repeats as a no-op, and delivers an actionable close to an idle main as one turn-starting wake
ok - .omp watch extension: an in-process helper session's start and shutdown leave the owner armed and are logged as inert; a genuine replacement still takes over
ok - .omp watch extension: after a restart, a handed-off close whose queued wake was already acknowledged is not replayed
ok - .omp watch extension: after a restart, a handed-off close whose queued wake is still unacknowledged is replayed exactly once
ok - .omp watch extension: closes sharing one pending recovery generation replay per wake, so acknowledging row 7 replays only row 8
ok - .omp watch extension: idle wakes start turns, unconsumed ones are re-poked once, and a streaming main gets follow-ups
ok - .omp watch extension: the context event replaces every wake kind whose own row main acknowledged and passes queued, batch-sibling, and reason-only wakes unchanged
ok - .omp watch extension: an acknowledged wake carrying an appended watcher failure reaches the model unchanged
ok - .omp watch extension: a dropped wake rewrites only its own message, and a later identical wake stays live and pending
